            <p style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold); margin: 22px 0 8px;">Also Accepted</p>
            <div class="plan-chips">
              <span class="plan-chip">BCBS</span>
              <span class="plan-chip">Aetna</span>
              <span class="plan-chip">Cigna (Evernorth)</span>
              <span class="plan-chip">UnitedHealthcare / Optum</span>
              <span class="plan-chip">Humana</span>
              <span class="plan-chip">Oscar</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- RELATED SERVICES -->
    <section class="section" style="background: var(--cream);">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Explore More</span>
        <h2>Related ways I can help.</h2>
        <div class="related-grid">
          <a class="related-card reveal" href="mens-mental-health.html">
            <h3>Men's Mental Health</h3>
            <p>A direct approach for high-functioning men carrying stress, anger, and burnout — without the small talk.</p>
            <span class="go">Learn more &rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a class="related-card reveal" href="couples-therapy.html">
            <h3>Couples Therapy</h3>
            <p>Rebuild communication, work through recurring conflict, and reconnect when deployments and distance have taken a toll.</p>
            <span class="go">Learn more &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="final-cta">
      <div class="container reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">You Held The Line. Let Someone Hold It With You.</span>
        <h2>Take the first step on your terms.</h2>
        <p>A free 15-minute consultation is a low-pressure way to see if the fit is right — no commitment, no paperwork. Reach out by phone, email, or book online.</p>
        <div class="button-row" style="justify-content: center;">
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/intake.html">Book a Free Consultation</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="contact.html">Contact David</a>
        </div>      </div>
